   "quantity": "shear and torsion, general method: sqrt(f'c) cap; torsion as equivalent wall shear; ex = (M/dv + Veff + a N - Apt spo) / (2 (Es Ast + Ep Apt [+ Ec Act])) clamped; theta = a + b ex (deg); kv = a / (1 + b ex) x (min. steel ? 1 : c / (d + kdg dv)); kdg = max(min, a / (b + dg)); Asv,min = k sqrt(f'c) bv / fsy.f; Vu,max = k f'c bv dv cot / (1 + cot^2); Asw,min = k y1 / fsy.f; Tcr = k sqrt(f'c) Acp^2 / uc; longitudinal tension M / (lever dv) + axial N / phi + cot sqrt((V/phi - Pv - vus Vus)^2 + (torsion uh T / (2 Ao phi))^2)",
   "units": "-",
